<title>POLAND: BFK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April.</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.70 vs   2.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.10 vs   4.86</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.60 vs   5.62</p>
<p> Sales		   34.10 vs  29.81</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.67 vs   6.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	23.20 vs  12.07</p>
<p> Operating profit    25.08 vs  14.85</p>
<p> Sales		  120.61 vs 102.64</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Wasaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
